# Build context exclusions — keep the image lean.

# Crawled artifacts and logs
**/output
**/log
**/logs
**/checkpoints

# Python caches
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ipynb_checkpoints

# Editor / OS
.git
.gitignore
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store

# Backups + scratch
**/*.bak
**/*.tmp
**/_backup_v1
**/Untitled-*.ipynb
**/test.py

# Secrets — never bake into the image
**/tokens.json
!**/tokens.json.example

# Docs that aren't needed inside the container
*.md
!README.md
!metadata_collection/README.md
!skills_repos/README.md
